---
// IntegrationVsAutomation.astro (Jasa Integrasi Sistem)
---

<section class="vs-section">
  <div class="vs-container">
    
    <div class="section-header animate-fade-scroll" style="animation-delay: 100ms;">
      <h2 class="header-title">Integrasi Sistem vs Workflow Automation</h2>
      <p class="header-intro">
        Keduanya sering dianggap sama, namun memiliki fokus yang berbeda. Di Entercraft, kami dapat membangun keduanya untuk menghasilkan ekosistem digital yang sempurna.
      </p>
    </div>

    <div class="vs-grid">
      
      <!-- System Integration -->
      <div class="vs-card animate-fade-scroll" style="animation-delay: 200ms;">
        <div class="card-icon blue">
          <svg width="32" height="32" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="2" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round"><rect x="2" y="3" width="20" height="14" rx="2" ry="2"></rect><line x1="8" y1="21" x2="16" y2="21"></line><line x1="12" y1="17" x2="12" y2="21"></line></svg>
        </div>
        <div class="card-content">
          <h3>Integrasi Sistem (Membangun Pipa)</h3>
          <p>
            Berfokus pada <strong>infrastruktur</strong>. Tujuannya adalah membuat dua sistem yang berbeda bisa saling "berbicara" dan mengenali data satu sama lain.
          </p>
          <ul>
            <li>Sinkronisasi data (Customer, Inventory)</li>
            <li>Mengamankan pertukaran data</li>
            <li>Berjalan di level background (Data flow)</li>
          </ul>
        </div>
      </div>

      <div class="vs-divider animate-fade-scroll" style="animation-delay: 300ms;">
        <span>+</span>
      </div>

      <!-- Workflow Automation -->
      <div class="vs-card animate-fade-scroll" style="animation-delay: 400ms;">
        <div class="card-icon purple">
          <svg width="32" height="32" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="2" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round"><path d="M12 2v20"></path><path d="M17 5H9.5a3.5 3.5 0 0 0 0 7h5a3.5 3.5 0 0 1 0 7H6"></path></svg>
        </div>
        <div class="card-content">
          <h3>Workflow Automation (Mengatur Lalu Lintas)</h3>
          <p>
            Berfokus pada <strong>logika operasional</strong> (If this, then that). Tujuannya adalah menggantikan pekerjaan klik-klik manual yang dilakukan oleh manusia.
          </p>
          <ul>
            <li>Merespons event (Order Masuk -> Notifikasi Slack)</li>
            <li>Multi-step logic (Approval, conditional routing)</li>
            <li>Berfokus pada penyelesaian tugas harian</li>
          </ul>
        </div>
      </div>

    </div>

  </div>
</section>

<style>
  .vs-section {
    position: relative;
    width: 100%;
    background-color: var(--bg-primary);
    padding: 100px 24px;
    box-sizing: border-box;
  }

  .vs-container {
    max-width: 1000px;
    margin: 0 auto;
  }

  .section-header {
    text-align: center;
    margin-bottom: 60px;
    display: flex;
    flex-direction: column;
    align-items: center;
  }

  .header-title {
    font-family: 'Plus Jakarta Sans', sans-serif;
    font-size: 38px;
    font-weight: 800;
    line-height: 1.2;
    letter-spacing: -1px;
    color: #FFFFFF;
    margin: 0 0 20px 0;
  }

  .header-intro {
    font-family: 'Inter', sans-serif;
    font-size: 16px;
    line-height: 1.7;
    color: #94A3B8;
    max-width: 700px;
    margin: 0;
  }

  .vs-grid {
    display: flex;
    align-items: stretch;
    gap: 24px;
  }

  .vs-card {
    flex: 1;
    background-color: rgba(10, 22, 44, 0.4);
    border: 1px solid var(--border-color);
    border-radius: 16px;
    padding: 40px;
    display: flex;
    flex-direction: column;
    align-items: center;
    text-align: center;
    gap: 24px;
  }

  .card-icon {
    width: 72px;
    height: 72px;
    border-radius: 16px;
    display: flex;
    align-items: center;
    justify-content: center;
  }

  .card-icon.blue {
    background: rgba(57, 132, 255, 0.1);
    color: var(--accent-blue);
    border: 1px solid rgba(57, 132, 255, 0.3);
  }

  .card-icon.purple {
    background: rgba(139, 92, 246, 0.1);
    color: #A78BFA;
    border: 1px solid rgba(139, 92, 246, 0.3);
  }

  .card-content {
    display: flex;
    flex-direction: column;
    gap: 16px;
    align-items: center;
  }

  .card-content h3 {
    font-family: 'Plus Jakarta Sans', sans-serif;
    font-size: 22px;
    font-weight: 700;
    color: #FFFFFF;
    margin: 0;
  }

  .card-content p {
    font-family: 'Inter', sans-serif;
    font-size: 15px;
    line-height: 1.6;
    color: #94A3B8;
    margin: 0;
  }

  .card-content p strong {
    color: #E2E8F0;
  }

  .card-content ul {
    list-style: none;
    padding: 0;
    margin: 0;
    display: flex;
    flex-direction: column;
    gap: 12px;
    width: 100%;
    margin-top: 10px;
  }

  .card-content ul li {
    font-family: 'Inter', sans-serif;
    font-size: 14px;
    color: #E2E8F0;
    background: rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.03);
    padding: 12px;
    border-radius: 8px;
    border: 1px solid rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.05);
  }

  .vs-divider {
    display: flex;
    align-items: center;
    justify-content: center;
  }

  .vs-divider span {
    font-size: 32px;
    color: #475569;
    font-weight: bold;
    width: 48px;
    height: 48px;
    background: var(--bg-secondary);
    border: 1px solid var(--border-color);
    border-radius: 50%;
    display: flex;
    align-items: center;
    justify-content: center;
  }

  .animate-fade-scroll {
    opacity: 0;
    transform: translateY(15px);
    animation: fadeInUp 0.6s cubic-bezier(0.16, 1, 0.3, 1) forwards;
  }

  @keyframes fadeInUp {
    to {
      opacity: 1;
      transform: translateY(0);
    }
  }

  /* Light Theme Specific Adjustments */
  :global(html[data-theme="light"]) .vs-section {
    background-color: #FFFFFF;
  }
  
  :global(html[data-theme="light"]) .header-title {
    color: #0F172A;
  }
  
  :global(html[data-theme="light"]) .header-intro {
    color: #475569;
  }
  
  :global(html[data-theme="light"]) .vs-card {
    background-color: #F8FAFC;
    border-color: #E2E8F0;
    box-shadow: 0 4px 6px -1px rgba(0, 0, 0, 0.05);
  }

  :global(html[data-theme="light"]) .card-content h3 {
    color: #0F172A;
  }

  :global(html[data-theme="light"]) .card-content p {
    color: #64748B;
  }

  :global(html[data-theme="light"]) .card-content p strong {
    color: #0F172A;
  }

  :global(html[data-theme="light"]) .card-content ul li {
    background: #FFFFFF;
    border-color: #E2E8F0;
    color: #334155;
  }

  :global(html[data-theme="light"]) .vs-divider span {
    background: #F8FAFC;
    border-color: #E2E8F0;
    color: #94A3B8;
  }

  @media (max-width: 991px) {
    .vs-grid {
      flex-direction: column;
    }
    .vs-divider {
      padding: 16px 0;
    }
  }

  @media (max-width: 767px) {
    .vs-section {
      padding: 60px 16px;
    }
    .header-title {
      font-size: 30px;
    }
    .vs-card {
      padding: 24px;
    }
  }
</style>
